{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfoldink is a <strong>2D logical puzzle adventure</strong> game where you <strong>craft unique combinations of cards</strong>, to come up with <strong>animated stories</strong> that explain the tribe's depararature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/8d12def6b832ce4481ea48bd63105152.poster.avif?t=1756738786\" width=800 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/8d12def6b832ce4481ea48bd63105152.webm?t=1756738786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/8d12def6b832ce4481ea48bd63105152.mp4?t=1756738786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNFOLDINK OFFERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-&gt; <strong>Unique</strong> mind boggling\u00a0puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0-&gt; Total of <strong>11 different cards</strong> and...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/dda3c1385d468089d91f9a59e2540ce1.avif?t=1756738786\" width=874 height=492 /></span><strong>...over</strong> <strong>160 animated combinations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-&gt; Surprising and <strong>funny</strong> character <strong>interactions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/16c4319d8dad0c1184ca91de68c7742f.poster.avif?t=1756738786\" width=784 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/16c4319d8dad0c1184ca91de68c7742f.webm?t=1756738786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/16c4319d8dad0c1184ca91de68c7742f.mp4?t=1756738786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-&gt; Control animals, hunters and locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-&gt; Easy to understand gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-&gt; Between <strong>45 to 60 minute</strong> play through</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/978927a281683fe8343991b72cb9d007.poster.avif?t=1756738786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/978927a281683fe8343991b72cb9d007.webm?t=1756738786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/978927a281683fe8343991b72cb9d007.mp4?t=1756738786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ORIGINAL STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ancient tribe in the Amazon rainforest left a trace of why they have left their camp base. Were they forced or did they want to leave ? Use the cards they left behind in <strong>various combinations</strong> to piece together the stories of <strong>what actually happened</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/746f09519a889089a07d89806d8a0677.poster.avif?t=1756738786\" width=794 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/746f09519a889089a07d89806d8a0677.webm?t=1756738786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/746f09519a889089a07d89806d8a0677.mp4?t=1756738786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/cb657230b25e70457a567e46e4c0a5eb.poster.avif?t=1756738786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/cb657230b25e70457a567e46e4c0a5eb.webm?t=1756738786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/cb657230b25e70457a567e46e4c0a5eb.mp4?t=1756738786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's</strong> time to UNFOLD the truth hidden within their strokes of INK. <strong>Many</strong> people have tried\u00a0before, but\u00a0<strong>you\u00a0are the only one</strong> that can crack this <strong>mystery</strong>. </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome To The Tribe!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3252250/4c12c88bf44d4bd1b52bbd71e32c53ed845ffb9c.jpg"},{"name":"Coudn't You Do That Solo?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3252250/16ebb727dccb22bae3198a200c4e565087784837.jpg"},{"name":"Who Needs The Crocodile Anyways?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3252250/be7575ec8b68d486e1f2fcd94cb565c74d57caac.jpg"},{"name":"Capybara's Revenge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3252250/5e64ab3d295341a3351f6d96bcea5b2058f5ed80.jpg"},{"name":"Musician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3252250/8526f1c4376da99fd988056fc18aec5fd6a2b094.jpg"},{"name":"You Unfolded All Of The Ink","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com